{
  "en": {
    "AH64_NAME": "AH-64",
    "AH64_SUBTITLE": "The Gunship",
    "AH64_DESCRIPTION": "The AH-64 is a gunship that never lands, trading footspeed for altitude and a full weapons load.<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > The M230 carries a fixed drum and reloads all at once — it hits harder past {0}m, and only at {1}% within {2}m. Tap at range to keep the burst tight. The reload runs whether you emptied it or not, so top up before you commit.\n\n< ! > The rocket pods ripple over most of a second, so hold your aim through the salvo. Rockets deal {3}% damage within {4}m of flight and full damage from {5}m. They run on their own cooldown and stay available mid-reload.\n\n< ! > Evasive Roll is a climbing forward-diagonal barrel roll — stick snaps forward, left, or right with i-frames on the way through and armor for the length of the roll. {6}\n\n< ! > Fire Control Radar paints the strongest nearby threat. Hold Longbow to paint locks while you keep firing the gun and Hydra; release to launch. Hellfire stays as a loadout variant.\n\n",
    "AH64_LORE": "<style=cSub>Recovered airframe log, partial. Timestamps inconsistent.</style>\n\nCYCLE 0041 — Escort detail, low pass over the wreck line. No contacts. Rotor bed nominal.\n\nCYCLE 0042 — Contact. Contact. Nothing in the threat library matches. Expended the drum, reloaded, expended it again. Radar kept painting new returns faster than the launcher could clear them.\n\nCYCLE 0058 — Requested relief. No response on any band. Requested landing clearance. No response.\n\nCYCLE 0061 — Field expedient: skids removed. Ninety kilos saved and nothing left to land on anyway. Endurance is no longer a fuel question.\n\nCYCLE 0103 — The gun runs. The pods run. The radar still finds the biggest thing on the field and holds onto it. Whatever the mission was, it has been replaced by the part of it that still works.\n\n<style=cSub>Log continues. Entry count exceeds airframe rated service life by a factor of nine.</style>",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..and so it left, airframe scorched, directives intact.",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..and so it went down, another airframe lost to the Provinces.",
    "AH64_DESERT_SKIN_NAME": "Desert Tan",
    "AH64_ARCTIC_SKIN_NAME": "Arctic",
    "AH64_ARMY_SKIN_NAME": "Army Green",
    "AH64_NIGHT_SKIN_NAME": "Night Stalker",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_NAME": "Fire Control Radar",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "The mast radar paints the <style=cIsUtility>strongest nearby enemy</style>. Deal <style=cIsUtility>{0}% increased damage</style> to the painted target, gain <style=cIsUtility>{1}% movement speed</style> while facing them, and <style=cIsUtility>{2} armor</style> while close.",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED": "TARGET ACQUIRED",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED_DESC": "Fire Control Radar",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_NAME": "M230 Chain Gun",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Agile.</style> Fire the chin turret for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% damage</style> per round, with a small HE blast for <style=cIsDamage>{1}% damage</style>. Both deal <style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style> within <style=cIsUtility>{3}m</style>, rising to full damage at <style=cIsUtility>{4}m</style>. Holds <style=cIsUtility>{5} rounds</style>, then reloads over <style=cIsUtility>{6}s</style>. Accuracy degrades while held.",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_NAME": "XM301 Rotary Cannon",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Agile.</style> Spin up a six-barrel rotary cannon for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% damage</style> per round, with a light blast for <style=cIsDamage>{1}% damage</style>. Both deal <style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style> within <style=cIsUtility>{3}m</style>, rising to full damage at <style=cIsUtility>{4}m</style>. <style=cIsUtility>Rate of fire climbs as the barrels spool up</style>. Holds <style=cIsUtility>{5} rounds</style>, then reloads over <style=cIsUtility>{6}s</style>. Less accurate than the M230.",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_NAME": "M789 Heavy Cannon",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Agile.</style> Fire slow, heavy shells for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% damage</style> each, with a <style=cIsUtility>large</style> blast for <style=cIsDamage>{1}% damage</style>. Holds <style=cIsUtility>{2} shells</style>, then reloads over <style=cIsUtility>{3}s</style>. Highly accurate, but every shot counts.",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_NAME": "Hydra-70 Pods",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Agile.</style> Ripple-fire unguided rockets from the wing pylons for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% damage</style> each. Damage is <style=cIsUtility>{1}%</style> within <style=cIsUtility>{2}m</style> of flight and full at <style=cIsUtility>{3}m</style>. Holds <style=cIsUtility>{4} rockets</style>, then reloads over <style=cIsUtility>{5}s</style>. Each <style=cIsUtility>Backup Magazine</style> adds one rocket and <style=cIsUtility>{6}s</style> to the reload.",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_NAME": "Evasive Roll",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_DESCRIPTION": "Barrel-roll <style=cIsUtility>forward, left, or right</style> on a climbing diagonal from your move input, bracing the plating for <style=cIsUtility>{0} armor</style> for <style=cIsUtility>{1}s</style>. <style=cIsUtility>You cannot be hit during the first half of the roll.</style> Hold jump afterward for altitude — the roll only hops.",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_NAME": "Smoke Backflip",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_DESCRIPTION": "Kick into an aerobatic <style=cIsUtility>backflip</style> — surge rearward and climb through a pitch loop while dumping smoke. <style=cIsUtility>Cloak</style> briefly as you fade back into the fight.",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_NAME": "AGM-114 Hellfire",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_DESCRIPTION": "Launch a missile from a wing rail that flies straight and detonates on contact for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% damage</style>.",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_NAME": "AGM-114L Longbow",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Hold</style> to paint enemies under the reticle, then <style=cIsUtility>release to launch</style> up to <style=cIsUtility>{0} guided missiles</style> from alternating inboard rails. Primary and secondary stay available while painting. Later locks hit harder (<style=cIsDamage>{1}% damage</style>–<style=cIsDamage>{2}% damage</style>), and further missiles stay at the top of that range. Each <style=cIsUtility>Lysate Cell</style> adds one missile to the rack.",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "AH-64: Mastery",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "As the AH-64, beat the game or obliterate on Monsoon.",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT_CLASSIC": "Hold jump to climb; let go to settle back down, or pull back to settle faster.",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT": "Hold jump to climb and {0} to drop; let go of both to hold your height. Time above resting height is limited, and extra jumps extend it.",
    "AH64_DESCEND_KEYBOARD": "{0} on keyboard",
    "AH64_DESCEND_CONTROLLER": "B on controller",
    "AH64_DESCEND_BINDINGS": "{0}, {1}",
    "AH64_DESCEND_WITH_BINDINGS": "descend ({0})",
    "AH64_DESCEND": "descend"
  },
  "zh-CN": {
    "AH64_NAME": "AH-64",
    "AH64_SUBTITLE": "武装直升机",
    "AH64_DESCRIPTION": "AH-64 是一架从不着陆的武装直升机，用脚步速度换取高度和全套武器。<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > M230 使用固定弹鼓，一次全部装填——超过 {0} 米后打得更疼，{2} 米内只有 {1}%。在远处点射，让短点射保持集中。无论有没有打空，装填都会开始，所以在投入交火前先补满。\n\n< ! > 火箭巢会在将近一秒内连射，齐射期间要稳住准星。火箭在飞出 {4} 米内造成 {3}% 伤害，从 {5} 米起造成全额伤害。它们有自己的冷却，主武器装填时仍然可用。\n\n< ! > 规避横滚是沿爬升斜线向前的桶滚——摇杆向前、向左或向右时，翻滚途中有无敌帧，整段翻滚期间还有护甲。{6}\n\n< ! > 火控雷达会标记附近最强的威胁。按住长弓可为目标上色锁定，同时继续射击机炮和 Hydra；松开即发射。地狱火仍作为配装变体保留。\n\n",
    "AH64_LORE": "<style=cSub>回收的机身日志，残缺。时间戳不一致。</style>\n\n周期 0041 — 护航任务，低空掠过残骸线。无接触。旋翼基座正常。\n\n周期 0042 — 接触。接触。威胁库中没有任何匹配。打空弹鼓，装填，再次打空。雷达标出新回波的速度比发射架清掉它们更快。\n\n周期 0058 — 请求换防。所有频段均无回应。请求着陆许可。无回应。\n\n周期 0061 — 现场权宜：滑橇已拆除。省下九十公斤，反正也没有地方可降落。续航不再是燃料问题。\n\n周期 0103 — 机炮还在打。火箭巢还在打。雷达仍然找得到场上最大的东西，并咬住不放。无论任务曾经是什么，它已经被其中仍能运作的那一部分取代。\n\n<style=cSub>日志仍在继续。条目数量已达到机身额定寿命的九倍。</style>",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..于是它离开了，机身焦黑，指令完好。",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..于是它坠落了，又一条机身消失在诸省。",
    "AH64_DESERT_SKIN_NAME": "沙漠黄",
    "AH64_ARCTIC_SKIN_NAME": "极地",
    "AH64_ARMY_SKIN_NAME": "军绿",
    "AH64_NIGHT_SKIN_NAME": "夜行者",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_NAME": "火控雷达",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "桅顶雷达会标记<style=cIsUtility>附近最强的敌人</style>。对标记目标造成<style=cIsUtility>{0}%额外伤害</style>，面向目标时获得<style=cIsUtility>{1}%移动速度</style>，靠近时获得<style=cIsUtility>{2}点护甲</style>。",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED": "目标锁定",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED_DESC": "火控雷达",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_NAME": "M230 链式机炮",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>机头炮塔每发造成<style=cIsDamage>{0}%伤害</style>，并附带小型高爆破片，造成<style=cIsDamage>{1}%伤害</style>。两者在<style=cIsUtility>{3}米</style>内造成<style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style>，到<style=cIsUtility>{4}米</style>升至全额伤害。弹鼓为<style=cIsUtility>{5}发</style>，装填需要<style=cIsUtility>{6}秒</style>。持续按住时精度下降。",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_NAME": "XM301 转管炮",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>让六管转管炮加速旋转，每发造成<style=cIsDamage>{0}%伤害</style>，并附带轻度爆炸，造成<style=cIsDamage>{1}%伤害</style>。两者在<style=cIsUtility>{3}米</style>内造成<style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style>，到<style=cIsUtility>{4}米</style>升至全额伤害。<style=cIsUtility>射速会随炮管加速而提高</style>。弹鼓为<style=cIsUtility>{5}发</style>，装填需要<style=cIsUtility>{6}秒</style>。精度不如 M230。",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_NAME": "M789 重型加农炮",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>发射缓慢而沉重的炮弹，每发造成<style=cIsDamage>{0}%伤害</style>，并附带<style=cIsUtility>大范围</style>爆炸，造成<style=cIsDamage>{1}%伤害</style>。弹鼓为<style=cIsUtility>{2}发</style>，装填需要<style=cIsUtility>{3}秒</style>。精度很高，但每一发都很珍贵。",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_NAME": "Hydra-70 火箭巢",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>从翼下挂架连射无制导火箭，每枚造成<style=cIsDamage>{0}%伤害</style>。飞行<style=cIsUtility>{2}米</style>内伤害为<style=cIsUtility>{1}%</style>，到<style=cIsUtility>{3}米</style>升至全额。挂架携带<style=cIsUtility>{4}枚火箭</style>，装填需要<style=cIsUtility>{5}秒</style>。每个<style=cIsUtility>备用弹匣</style>增加一枚火箭，并使装填延长<style=cIsUtility>{6}秒</style>。",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_NAME": "规避横滚",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_DESCRIPTION": "根据移动输入，沿爬升斜线向<style=cIsUtility>前、左或右</style>做桶滚，为机体加上<style=cIsUtility>{0}点护甲</style>，持续<style=cIsUtility>{1}秒</style>。<style=cIsUtility>翻滚前半段内不会受到伤害。</style>之后按住跳跃才能爬升——这次翻滚本身只会短暂跃起。",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_NAME": "烟雾后空翻",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_DESCRIPTION": "做一个特技<style=cIsUtility>后空翻</style>——向后猛冲，在俯仰筋斗中爬升，同时抛出烟雾。重新进入战斗时短暂<style=cIsUtility>隐匿</style>。",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_NAME": "AGM-114 地狱火",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_DESCRIPTION": "从翼下导轨发射一枚导弹。它直线飞行，命中时爆炸，造成<style=cIsDamage>{0}%伤害</style>。",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_NAME": "AGM-114L 长弓",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>按住</style>可为准星下的敌人上色，然后<style=cIsUtility>松开发射</style>，从左右内侧导轨交替射出至多<style=cIsUtility>{0}枚制导导弹</style>。上色期间主武器和副武器仍可使用。越晚锁定，伤害越高（<style=cIsDamage>{1}%伤害</style>–<style=cIsDamage>{2}%伤害</style>），更多的导弹保持在该上限。每个<style=cIsUtility>裂解细胞</style>为挂架增加一枚导弹。",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "AH-64：精通",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "以 AH-64 在季风难度下通关或湮灭。",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT_CLASSIC": "按住跳跃爬升；松开后回到静息高度，向后拉杆会更快回落。",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT": "按住跳跃爬升，并{0}以降低高度；两者都松开则保持当前高度。停留在静息高度以上的时间有限，额外跳跃可以延长。",
    "AH64_DESCEND_KEYBOARD": "键盘 {0}",
    "AH64_DESCEND_CONTROLLER": "手柄 B",
    "AH64_DESCEND_BINDINGS": "{0}，{1}",
    "AH64_DESCEND_WITH_BINDINGS": "下降（{0}）",
    "AH64_DESCEND": "下降"
  },
  "ru": {
    "AH64_NAME": "AH-64",
    "AH64_SUBTITLE": "Ударный вертолёт",
    "AH64_DESCRIPTION": "AH-64 — ударный вертолёт, который никогда не садится: вместо бега по земле у него высота и полный боекомплект.<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > У M230 фиксированный барабан, и он перезаряжается целиком — дальше {0} м удары тяжелее, а в пределах {2} м только {1}%. На дистанции стреляйте короткими очередями, чтобы кучность не расползалась. Перезарядка идёт, даже если барабан не пуст, так что пополните его до того, как ввяжетесь в бой.\n\n< ! > Ракетные блоки выпускают залп почти за секунду, поэтому держите прицел до конца очереди. Ракеты наносят {3}% урона в первые {4} м полёта и полный урон с {5} м. У них свой откат, и они доступны, пока перезаряжается основное оружие.\n\n< ! > Уклонение бочкой — набор высоты по диагонали вперёд. Стик вперёд, влево или вправо даёт кадры неуязвимости на проходе и броню на всё время бочки. {6}\n\n< ! > РЛС управления огнём помечает самую сильную цель поблизости. Удерживайте Longbow, чтобы вешать захваты, не прекращая огонь из пушки и Hydra; отпустите, чтобы пустить ракеты. Hellfire остаётся вариантом сборки.\n\n",
    "AH64_LORE": "<style=cSub>Подобранный бортовой журнал, неполный. Метки времени не сходятся.</style>\n\nЦИКЛ 0041 — Сопровождение, бреющий проход над линией обломков. Контактов нет. Ротор в норме.\n\nЦИКЛ 0042 — Контакт. Контакт. В библиотеке угроз совпадений нет. Барабан израсходован, перезаряжен, израсходован снова. Радар вешал новые отметки быстрее, чем пусковая успевала их снимать.\n\nЦИКЛ 0058 — Запрошена смена. Ответа нет ни на одном диапазоне. Запрошено разрешение на посадку. Ответа нет.\n\nЦИКЛ 0061 — Полевая мера: лыжи сняты. Девяносто кило сэкономлено, а садиться всё равно некуда. Выносливость больше не вопрос топлива.\n\nЦИКЛ 0103 — Пушка работает. Блоки работают. Радар по-прежнему находит самое крупное на поле и держит его. Чем бы ни была задача, её заменила та часть, которая ещё работает.\n\n<style=cSub>Журнал продолжается. Число записей превышает расчётный ресурс планера в девять раз.</style>",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..и оно ушло: корпус обуглен, директивы целы.",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..и оно упало, ещё один корпус потерян в Провинциях.",
    "AH64_DESERT_SKIN_NAME": "Пустынный",
    "AH64_ARCTIC_SKIN_NAME": "Арктика",
    "AH64_ARMY_SKIN_NAME": "Армейский зелёный",
    "AH64_NIGHT_SKIN_NAME": "Ночной сталкер",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_NAME": "РЛС управления огнём",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "Радар на мачте помечает <style=cIsUtility>сильнейшего врага поблизости</style>. Помеченная цель получает <style=cIsUtility>{0}% дополнительного урона</style>, лицом к ней даётся <style=cIsUtility>{1}% скорости передвижения</style>, а вблизи — <style=cIsUtility>{2} брони</style>.",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED": "ЦЕЛЬ ЗАХВАЧЕНА",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED_DESC": "РЛС управления огнём",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_NAME": "Цепная пушка M230",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Проворность.</style> Подбородочная турель наносит <style=cIsDamage>{0}% урона</style> за выстрел и небольшой фугасный разрыв на <style=cIsDamage>{1}% урона</style>. Оба дают <style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style> в пределах <style=cIsUtility>{3} м</style> и полный урон с <style=cIsUtility>{4} м</style>. Барабан на <style=cIsUtility>{5} патронов</style>, перезарядка <style=cIsUtility>{6} с</style>. При удержании точность падает.",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_NAME": "Роторная пушка XM301",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Проворность.</style> Раскрутите шестиствольную роторную пушку: <style=cIsDamage>{0}% урона</style> за выстрел и лёгкий разрыв на <style=cIsDamage>{1}% урона</style>. Оба дают <style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style> в пределах <style=cIsUtility>{3} м</style> и полный урон с <style=cIsUtility>{4} м</style>. <style=cIsUtility>Скорострельность растёт по мере раскрутки стволов</style>. Барабан на <style=cIsUtility>{5} патронов</style>, перезарядка <style=cIsUtility>{6} с</style>. Менее точная, чем M230.",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_NAME": "Тяжёлая пушка M789",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Проворность.</style> Медленные тяжёлые снаряды по <style=cIsDamage>{0}% урона</style>, с <style=cIsUtility>крупным</style> разрывом на <style=cIsDamage>{1}% урона</style>. Барабан на <style=cIsUtility>{2} снарядов</style>, перезарядка <style=cIsUtility>{3} с</style>. Очень точная, но каждый выстрел на счету.",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_NAME": "Блоки Hydra-70",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Проворность.</style> Залп неуправляемых ракет с подкрыльевых пилонов по <style=cIsDamage>{0}% урона</style> каждая. Урон <style=cIsUtility>{1}%</style> в первые <style=cIsUtility>{2} м</style> полёта и полный с <style=cIsUtility>{3} м</style>. Блок на <style=cIsUtility>{4} ракет</style>, перезарядка <style=cIsUtility>{5} с</style>. Каждый <style=cIsUtility>Запасной магазин</style> добавляет одну ракету и <style=cIsUtility>{6} с</style> к перезарядке.",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_NAME": "Уклонение бочкой",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_DESCRIPTION": "Бочка <style=cIsUtility>вперёд, влево или вправо</style> по восходящей диагонали от ввода движения. Обшивка получает <style=cIsUtility>{0} брони</style> на <style=cIsUtility>{1} с</style>. <style=cIsUtility>В первой половине бочки попасть по вам нельзя.</style> Высоту после этого даёт удержание прыжка — сама бочка лишь подскакивает.",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_NAME": "Дымовое сальто",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_DESCRIPTION": "Уйдите в фигуру <style=cIsUtility>сальто</style> — рывок назад и набор высоты в петле по тангажу, со сбросом дыма. На возврате в бой коротко даёт <style=cIsUtility>маскировку</style>.",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_NAME": "AGM-114 Hellfire",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_DESCRIPTION": "Пуск ракеты с подкрыльевой направляющей: летит прямо и взрывается при контакте, нанося <style=cIsDamage>{0}% урона</style>.",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_NAME": "AGM-114L Longbow",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Удерживайте</style>, чтобы помечать врагов под прицелом, затем <style=cIsUtility>отпустите для пуска</style> до <style=cIsUtility>{0} управляемых ракет</style> с чередующихся внутренних направляющих. Основное и дополнительное оружие доступны во время захвата. Поздние захваты бьют сильнее (<style=cIsDamage>{1}% урона</style>–<style=cIsDamage>{2}% урона</style>), а ракеты сверх этого остаются на верхней границе. Каждая <style=cIsUtility>Лизатная ячейка</style> добавляет одну ракету на подвеску.",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "AH-64: Мастерство",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "Играя за AH-64, пройдите игру или сотритесь на сложности «Муссон».",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT_CLASSIC": "Удерживайте прыжок, чтобы набирать высоту; отпустите, чтобы опуститься, или потяните стик назад, чтобы опуститься быстрее.",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT": "Удерживайте прыжок, чтобы набирать высоту, и {0}, чтобы снижаться; отпустите оба, чтобы держать высоту. Время выше высоты зависания ограничено, а дополнительные прыжки его продлевают.",
    "AH64_DESCEND_KEYBOARD": "{0} на клавиатуре",
    "AH64_DESCEND_CONTROLLER": "B на геймпаде",
    "AH64_DESCEND_BINDINGS": "{0}, {1}",
    "AH64_DESCEND_WITH_BINDINGS": "снижайтесь ({0})",
    "AH64_DESCEND": "снижайтесь"
  },
  "pt-BR": {
    "AH64_NAME": "AH-64",
    "AH64_SUBTITLE": "A Aeronave de Ataque",
    "AH64_DESCRIPTION": "O AH-64 é uma aeronave de ataque que nunca pousa: troca a corrida no chão por altitude e um carregamento completo de armas.<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > O M230 usa um tambor fixo e recarrega tudo de uma vez — acerta mais forte além de {0}m e só {1}% dentro de {2}m. Atire em toques à distância para manter a rajada fechada. A recarga acontece mesmo se o tambor não esvaziou, então complete antes de se comprometer.\n\n< ! > Os casulos disparam em sequência por quase um segundo, então segure a mira durante a salva. Os foguetes causam {3}% de dano nos primeiros {4}m de voo e dano total a partir de {5}m. Eles têm a própria recarga e continuam disponíveis enquanto a arma primária recarrega.\n\n< ! > Rolamento Evasivo é um barril em diagonal para frente e para cima — o manche para frente, esquerda ou direita dá quadros de invulnerabilidade na passagem e armadura durante o rolamento. {6}\n\n< ! > O Radar de Controle de Tiro marca a ameaça mais forte por perto. Segure Longbow para pintar travas enquanto continua atirando com o canhão e a Hydra; solte para lançar. Hellfire continua como variante de equipamento.\n\n",
    "AH64_LORE": "<style=cSub>Diário de célula recuperado, parcial. Os horários não batem.</style>\n\nCICLO 0041 — Escolta, passagem baixa sobre a linha de destroços. Nenhum contato. Berço do rotor nominal.\n\nCICLO 0042 — Contato. Contato. Nada na biblioteca de ameaças corresponde. Tambor gasto, recarregado, gasto de novo. O radar pintava retornos novos mais rápido do que o lançador conseguia limpá-los.\n\nCICLO 0058 — Solicitada a substituição. Nenhuma resposta em banda alguma. Pedida autorização de pouso. Nenhuma resposta.\n\nCICLO 0061 — Improviso de campo: esquis removidos. Noventa quilos a menos e, de todo modo, nada em que pousar. A autonomia deixou de ser uma questão de combustível.\n\nCICLO 0103 — O canhão funciona. Os casulos funcionam. O radar ainda acha a maior coisa no campo e não solta. Seja qual for a missão, ela foi substituída pela parte que ainda funciona.\n\n<style=cSub>O diário continua. O número de entradas supera a vida útil nominal da célula por um fator de nove.</style>",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..e assim ele partiu, fuselagem chamuscada, diretivas intactas.",
    "AH64_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..e assim ele caiu, mais uma fuselagem perdida nas Províncias.",
    "AH64_DESERT_SKIN_NAME": "Areia do Deserto",
    "AH64_ARCTIC_SKIN_NAME": "Ártico",
    "AH64_ARMY_SKIN_NAME": "Verde Exército",
    "AH64_NIGHT_SKIN_NAME": "Perseguidor Noturno",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_NAME": "Radar de Controle de Tiro",
    "AH64_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "O radar do mastro marca <style=cIsUtility>o inimigo mais forte por perto</style>. Cause <style=cIsUtility>{0}% de dano aumentado</style> ao alvo marcado, ganhe <style=cIsUtility>{1}% de velocidade de movimento</style> enquanto estiver de frente para ele e <style=cIsUtility>{2} de armadura</style> quando estiver perto.",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED": "ALVO ADQUIRIDO",
    "AH64_RADAR_TARGET_ACQUIRED_DESC": "Radar de Controle de Tiro",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_NAME": "Canhão de Corrente M230",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CHAINGUN_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Ágil.</style> A torreta do queixo causa <style=cIsDamage>{0}% de dano</style> por tiro, com uma pequena explosão HE de <style=cIsDamage>{1}% de dano</style>. Ambos causam <style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style> dentro de <style=cIsUtility>{3}m</style> e dano total a partir de <style=cIsUtility>{4}m</style>. O tambor tem <style=cIsUtility>{5} tiros</style> e recarrega em <style=cIsUtility>{6}s</style>. A precisão cai enquanto o disparo é mantido.",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_NAME": "Canhão Rotativo XM301",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_GATLING_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Ágil.</style> Acelere um canhão rotativo de seis canos para <style=cIsDamage>{0}% de dano</style> por tiro, com uma explosão leve de <style=cIsDamage>{1}% de dano</style>. Ambos causam <style=cIsUtility>{2}%</style> dentro de <style=cIsUtility>{3}m</style> e dano total a partir de <style=cIsUtility>{4}m</style>. <style=cIsUtility>A cadência sobe conforme os canos aceleram</style>. O tambor tem <style=cIsUtility>{5} tiros</style> e recarrega em <style=cIsUtility>{6}s</style>. Menos preciso que o M230.",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_NAME": "Canhão Pesado M789",
    "AH64_PRIMARY_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Ágil.</style> Dispara granadas lentas e pesadas de <style=cIsDamage>{0}% de dano</style> cada, com uma explosão <style=cIsUtility>grande</style> de <style=cIsDamage>{1}% de dano</style>. O tambor tem <style=cIsUtility>{2} granadas</style> e recarrega em <style=cIsUtility>{3}s</style>. Muito preciso, mas cada tiro conta.",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_NAME": "Casulos Hydra-70",
    "AH64_SECONDARY_ROCKETPODS_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Ágil.</style> Dispara foguetes não guiados dos pilones das asas em sequência, <style=cIsDamage>{0}% de dano</style> cada. O dano é <style=cIsUtility>{1}%</style> nos primeiros <style=cIsUtility>{2}m</style> de voo e total a partir de <style=cIsUtility>{3}m</style>. Carrega <style=cIsUtility>{4} foguetes</style> e recarrega em <style=cIsUtility>{5}s</style>. Cada <style=cIsUtility>Carregador Reserva</style> adiciona um foguete e <style=cIsUtility>{6}s</style> à recarga.",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_NAME": "Rolamento Evasivo",
    "AH64_UTILITY_DASH_DESCRIPTION": "Faça um barril <style=cIsUtility>para frente, para a esquerda ou para a direita</style> numa diagonal ascendente, conforme o movimento. A blindagem ganha <style=cIsUtility>{0} de armadura</style> por <style=cIsUtility>{1}s</style>. <style=cIsUtility>Você não pode ser atingido na primeira metade do rolamento.</style> Segure o pulo depois para ganhar altitude — o rolamento só dá um salto.",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_NAME": "Cambalhota de Fumaça",
    "AH64_UTILITY_BACKFLIP_DESCRIPTION": "Entre num <style=cIsUtility>salto mortal</style> acrobático — dispare para trás e suba num loop de arfagem enquanto solta fumaça. <style=cIsUtility>Camufle-se</style> por um instante ao voltar à luta.",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_NAME": "AGM-114 Hellfire",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_HELLFIRE_DESCRIPTION": "Lança um míssil do trilho da asa. Ele voa em linha reta e detona no contato, causando <style=cIsDamage>{0}% de dano</style>.",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_NAME": "AGM-114L Longbow",
    "AH64_SPECIAL_LONGBOW_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Segure</style> para pintar inimigos sob a retícula e <style=cIsUtility>solte para lançar</style> até <style=cIsUtility>{0} mísseis guiados</style> de trilhos internos alternados. A primária e a secundária continuam disponíveis enquanto pinta. Travas mais tardias acertam mais forte (<style=cIsDamage>{1}% de dano</style>–<style=cIsDamage>{2}% de dano</style>), e mísseis além disso ficam no topo desse alcance. Cada <style=cIsUtility>Célula de Lisado</style> adiciona um míssil ao cabide.",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "AH-64: Maestria",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_AH64_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "Como o AH-64, vença o jogo ou oblitere-se na Monção.",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT_CLASSIC": "Segure o pulo para subir; solte para descer de volta ou puxe para trás para descer mais rápido.",
    "AH64_ALTITUDE_HINT": "Segure o pulo para subir e {0} para descer; solte os dois para manter a altura. O tempo acima da altura de repouso é limitado, e pulos extras o prolongam.",
    "AH64_DESCEND_KEYBOARD": "{0} no teclado",
    "AH64_DESCEND_CONTROLLER": "B no controle",
    "AH64_DESCEND_BINDINGS": "{0}, {1}",
    "AH64_DESCEND_WITH_BINDINGS": "desça ({0})",
    "AH64_DESCEND": "desça"
  }
}
